| Step | Thread A | Thread B | Shared state |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | read tickets -> 1 |  | one ticket available |
| 2 |  | read tickets -> 1 | both may approve the same ticket |
| 3 | perform unprotected reservation |  | conflicting ordinary accesses |
| 4 |  | perform unprotected reservation | C data race; no guaranteed final state |

Fix:
```diff
--- prog.c
+++ prog.c (fixed)
@@ -21,7 +21,9 @@
