Line 22: `(void)p; P(done); V(offered); return NULL;`

The agent waits for a completion acknowledgment before making the offer whose service would produce it.

| Step | Thread A | Thread B | Shared state |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | P(done) blocks |  | done=0; no offer yet |
| 2 |  | P(offered) blocks | offered=0; neither can reach its post |

