| Step | Thread A | Thread B | Shared state |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | outer lock(m) succeeds |  | m=A |
| 2 | helper lock(m) blocks |  | normal m already owned by A |
| 3 |  | lock(m) blocks | no worker can reach A’s outer exit |

