answer:
Verdict: bug found

Line 33: `SO(sem_init(&resource,0,2));`

resource is an exclusion gate between a reader cohort and a writer, not a two-user capacity limiter. Two initial permits allow forbidden overlap.

| Step | Thread A | Thread B | Shared state |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | first reader P(resource) succeeds |  | one of two permits retained by reader cohort |
| 2 |  | writer P(resource) succeeds | second permit admits writer |
