| Step | Thread A | Thread B | Shared state |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | unlock(m) after first update |  | m free but still shared |
| 2 | destroy(m) |  | A destroys an object B will use |
| 3 | V(next) |  | B’s next phase enabled |
| 4 |  | lock(m) attempts | use of a destroyed mutex |

